# Chinese translation, generated from the project's translation table.

msg-chall00-0 = 
    一名卫兵指着你，随即向同伴喊道：“我认得他们！他们是通缉犯——把他们都抓起来！”卫兵们持械朝你冲来。你……<br><p><p><opt-battle>...<indent>抽出武器，奋起反击。<br><p><opt>...<indent>转身沿侧街疾驰，仗敏捷轻装，胜过追兵。<br><p><opt>...<indent>凭三寸不烂之舌，力图化解危机。<br><p><opt>...<indent>以 $Money1 收买守卫。<br><p><opt-items>...<indent>投掷炼金炸弹，引其分心，随即奔走。<br><p><opt-saints>...<indent>向圣徒恳求制止他们。<br><p><opt>...<indent>平和投降，不作抵抗。
msg-chall00-1 = 
    You defeat the guards utterly. Turning your backs on their bleeding bodies, you go about your business.{" "}
msg-chall00-2 = 
    Charging, you cut your way through the guards and escape into an alley. They do not pursue, since they do not relish more of the punishment you have just administered.{" "}
msg-chall00-3 = 
    Backing off from the guards, you flee down the street. Behind you, a trumpet blows, summoning reinforcements.{" "}
msg-chall00-4 = 
    卫兵将汝等悉数逮捕。沮丧之间，押赴地牢。一卫兵幸灾乐祸：“法官自会处置尔等贱民。”
msg-chall00-5 = 
    Rather than interfere with the guards' momentum, $ChosenOneName points further down the street and yells, "That's right, boys! The guys you want just ran around the corner. Go get 'em!" The guards, encouraged, run on past you. Their sergeant chases them, expostulating futilely. Before he convinces his squad of their error, you have escaped into the maze of city streets.{" "}
msg-chall00-6 = 
    你的首领$ChosenOneName含笑称许：“甚好，军士。你已通过考验，识破我与部下伪装成通缉暴徒。我将为你向长官美言。”<br><p>
    满意地，中士挺直了腰板。你离开时，$ChosenOneName 又鼓励他道：“睁大眼睛。真正的恶棍还在外面。把他们抓起来，我就把你的薪水翻倍。”中士勤勉地带着手下离去，仔细打量着过往行人。等他转过街角，你忍不住大笑一声，继续前行。
msg-chall00-7 = 
    众人怒目而视，纷纷举起武器。$ChosenOneName嘴角一撇，你则轻松地单手旋转着你的 $NamedOneName。你们中一人嘶声道：“我要他的靴子。”<br><p>
    听到这阴森的回应，卫兵们犹豫不决。你们中又一人哀嚎道：“又来了？还记得上次在维德尔斯海姆吗？收拾那些残骸可真麻烦！”$ChosenOneName开始阴沉地逼近。<br><p>
    The guards, cowed, retreat in confusion. Their sergeant blurts out apologies. They stumble back around a corner and, when they think you can no longer see them, break into a run. You laugh and move along.{" "}
msg-chall00-8 = 
    你郑重向守备队长说明其误判，称汝等并非其所寻之人。你指出汝等与通缉罪犯之间诸多明显差异。无奈，他全然不信。<br><p>
    他双目微眯。“把他们抓起来，你们这些蠢货！”他对卫兵怒吼道，“他们在拖延时间。”卫兵挥舞着武器向你逼近。你必须迎战。
msg-chall00-9 = 
    Grudgingly, the guard sergeant inspects your offering. He and his men are mercenaries, after all, and your money is good. Making a quick decision, he and his men divvy up the coins and let you pass.{" "}
msg-chall00-10 = 
    The guard sergeant inspects your coins and his lip curls. "Trying to bribe an official of mighty $PlaceName, eh? Boys, capture those felons!"{" "}
msg-chall00-11 = 
    When $ChosenOneName tosses the potion bottle, it explodes with a loud "pop!" and the guards are temporarily blinded. You easily evade their flailing weapons and slip down a side alley.{" "}
msg-chall00-12 = 
    由$ChosenOneName掷下的药瓶中涌出浓重的烟雾。守卫在迷雾中看不见你。你也看不清他们，但这并非你的计划。你只想轻松逃脱。
msg-chall00-13 = 
    Vapor flows out of $ChosenOneName's vial and turns the cobblestones into a sucking goo. The guards, dismayed, are glued like flies on a web. Laughing at their struggles, you calmly stroll away down a side alley.{" "}
msg-chall00-14 = 
    The $NamedOneName potion vaporizes, but not close enough to have the desired effect. A few guards stop briefly, but then they all advance on you, weapons at the ready.{" "}
msg-chall00-15 = 
    勤勉地向诸圣祈求，$ChosenOneName 高声而长久地祈祷。卫兵们停下脚步，感到困惑。祈祷结束时，你满怀期待地等待着。然而，什么也没有发生。卫兵们继续向前推进。
msg-chall00-16 = 
    Asking Saint Christina's mercy, $ChosenOneName prays that you may be removed from the presence of the onrushing guards. She answers, and a clear golden light embraces you all. You are lifted high up, far from the seething nest of the city beneath. You are sped through the crisp, clean air until you are deposited gently and safely on a verdant hillside, far from noisome, dangerous $PlaceName.{" "}
msg-chall00-17 = 
    清亮而有力，$ChosenOneName的声音响起，你恳求$NamedOneName助你一臂之力。天穹裂开，光芒自云层后射出，直贯冲来的卫兵胸膛。他们一时惊疑，随即微笑，放下武器，示意你平安离去。你欣然照办。
msg-chall00-18 = 
    圣莱诺德之名被$ChosenOneName唤起，他以神力回应。附近一幢无窗的高楼陡然光芒大盛。$ChosenOneName引领你们前往那座建筑。你们轻盈地自地面跃上石墙。无视重力，你们皆沿墙面而行，身体与下方地面平行。<br><p>
    Dumbfounded, the guards grovel below, too amazed for words. They keep staring after you long after you have disappeared from view and climbed down the building's other side.{" "}
